The Hershey font data in this directory and the layout code in LineDream/primitives/hershey_text.py are
vendored from vpype (https://github.com/abey79/vpype), which adapted them from fogleman/axi
(https://github.com/fogleman/axi). The fonts were converted from vpype's pickles to JSON; each glyph is
[left, right, [[x0, y0, x1, y1, ...], ...]].

